            %em topology
            that is of this form for some subterminal object
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi U
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U
            is called
            = succeed "." do
              %em open
          %h2#example Example
          %p
