                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sh_{c(U)}(\mathcal{E})
            as well e.g. in the case of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℰ
                  %mo =
                  %mi Sh
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
