                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi Sh
                      %mrow
                        %mi o
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi U
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi ℰ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sh_{o(U)}(\mathcal{E})
              the corresponding closed, resp. open subtoposes. Then
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
